1
00:00:00,377 --> 00:00:02,907
(Sheldon:)You know, the more
I think about it,

2
00:00:02,912 --> 00:00:06,552
(Sheldon:)the more intrigued I am
about having our own store.

3
00:00:06,549 --> 00:00:08,519
(Howard:)We'll get to see
all the new stuff

4
00:00:08,518 --> 00:00:10,148
(Howard:)before it hits the shelves.

5
00:00:10,153 --> 00:00:12,083
(Sheldon:)And we'll get to have
fun interactions

6
00:00:12,088 --> 00:00:13,388
(Sheldon:)with our customers.

7
00:00:13,390 --> 00:00:16,960
"This isn't a library--
buy it or get out."

8
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:19,930
(Howard:)You say things like that
all the time.

9
00:00:19,929 --> 00:00:22,299
(Sheldon:)Yes, but as a store owner,
I'll finally have
a good comeback

10
00:00:22,298 --> 00:00:24,498
to, "You don't work here--
shut up."

11
00:00:25,969 --> 00:00:28,339
(Leonard:)Uh, do you know how Penny
told Raj he should have

12
00:00:28,338 --> 00:00:30,108
(Leonard:)left her off his list?
Yeah.

13
00:00:30,106 --> 00:00:32,676
(Leonard:)Well, do you think when she
and I had that conversation,

14
00:00:32,676 --> 00:00:34,146
she left people off her list?

15
00:00:34,144 --> 00:00:35,444
(Sheldon:)I'm sure she did.

16
00:00:35,445 --> 00:00:37,515
(Leonard:)Why?

17
00:00:37,514 --> 00:00:39,314
(Sheldon:)Because if she hadn't,

18
00:00:39,315 --> 00:00:42,955
(Sheldon:)she'd still be wading
through the list.

19
00:00:42,952 --> 00:00:44,682
(Leonard:)Will you stay out of this?

20
00:00:44,688 --> 00:00:47,188
(chuckles) If only Penny
had said that once in a while.

21
00:00:49,492 --> 00:00:50,992
(Howard:)Hey, what difference
does it make?

22
00:00:50,994 --> 00:00:52,794
(Howard:)You're the one
she wants to marry.

23
00:00:52,796 --> 00:00:54,526
(Leonard:)That's true.
Yeah, and I'm not sure

24
00:00:54,531 --> 00:00:57,461
(Howard:)that complete honesty
is always the best thing

